  "description": "A public HTTPS address for a Shiny.AppDeviceBridge server, opened and closed while the app runs — an SSH tunnel to a public host such as pinggy, in managed code, so it works on phones as well as desktops. Everything arriving through it is treated as a caller from the network: never on the device, never the WebView. Plain net11.0 with no MAUI. One call: bridge.AddTunnel().",
